# (format 34, the user's) the dub sirens' knobs: a siren's key held (black 8-11 on the Arrangement page, past a third of
# a second: its slow one) gives it its own page, SIREN . WAIL, the knobs riding it while held: KNOB 1 Pitch (the tuned
# ones a note of the key a click; Whoop free, in tenths), KNOB 2 Rate (Wail and Hi-lo note values, Whoop and the Laser
# Hz), KNOB 3 Depth (semitones, the tuned ones on the key's notes), KNOB 4 Echo (the send; past 50 the feedback pushed);
# let go: back to the Arrangement page. Each siren keeps its four (its next tap or hold from them), global, saved
# (format 34); an older save gives the defaults (the sirens as they were)
listen
wait 3000
tap SEL
wait 200
expect view 17
# the defaults: Wail (Pitch 0, Rate 4 bars, Depth 12, Echo 50), Whoop (0, 2.5 Hz, 12, 50), Hi-lo (0, a quarter, 7, 50),
# Laser (0, 6 Hz, 24, 50); the Depth on the key's notes (F Dorian: 24, 22, 21)
expect sirk0 0
expect sirk1 11
expect sirk2 12
expect sirk3 50
expect sirk5 11
expect sirk9 3
expect sirk10 7
expect sirk13 15
expect sirk14 24
# a tap: no page
tapkey b7
wait 200
said WAIL
expect view 17
wait 3000
# held: Wail's page, till let go
key b7 down
wait 500
said WAIL HELD
expect view 30
expect sirpage 0
shot siren_wail.png
spin K2 -2
wait 300
expect sirk1 9
said Rate 2 bars
shot siren_wail_rate.png
# (Pitch centred: two clicks out of 0 held back, the notch; F Dorian: +2, +3 a click each)
spin K1 4
wait 300
said Pitch +3
expect sirk0 3
shot siren_wail_pitch.png
spin K1 -2
wait 300
expect sirk0 0
spin K3 1
wait 300
said Depth 14 st
expect sirk2 14
spin K3 -1
wait 300
expect sirk2 12
spin K4 20
wait 300
said Echo 70
expect sirk3 70
shot siren_wail_echo.png
expect sirenon 1
key b7 up
wait 300
expect view 17
wait 400
expect sirenon 0
# kept: held again, its page shows them
key b7 down
wait 500
expect view 30
expect sirk1 9
expect sirk3 70
key b7 up
wait 300
expect view 17
# Whoop: free, its Pitch in tenths, its Rate in Hz
key b8 down
wait 500
said WHOOP HELD
expect view 30
expect sirpage 1
shot siren_whoop.png
spin K1 -6
wait 300
said Pitch -0.4
expect sirk4 -4
spin K2 2
wait 300
said Rate 4.0 Hz
expect sirk5 13
shot siren_whoop_rate.png
key b8 up
wait 300
expect view 17
# Hi-lo and the Laser: their pages too
key b9 down
wait 500
expect view 30
expect sirpage 2
shot siren_hilo.png
spin K2 -1
wait 300
said Rate 1/8.
shot siren_hilo_rate.png
key b9 up
wait 300
key b10 down
wait 500
expect sirpage 3
shot siren_laser.png
spin K3 -2
wait 300
said Depth 21 st
shot siren_laser_depth.png
key b10 up
wait 300
expect view 17
# a new one takes over: Hi-lo held, a Laser tapped over it: the page goes (the Laser's a tap)
key b9 down
wait 500
expect view 30
tapkey b10
wait 200
expect view 17
key b9 up
wait 2000
# leaving the page lets a held one go, the page with it
key b7 down
wait 500
expect view 30
tap HOME
wait 400
expect sirenon 0
key b7 up
wait 200
expect view 0
# saved with the project (global), read back
press GLO
wait 600
release GLO
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 36
expect sirk1 9
expect sirk3 70
expect sirk4 -4
expect sirk5 13
expect sirk14 21
# an older save (format 32, today's layout without the knobs): the defaults
store32
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 36
expect sirk1 11
expect sirk3 50
expect sirk4 0
expect sirk5 11
expect sirk14 24
# and a format 31 one (written whole, the knobs' bytes as they were): the defaults too
tap SEL
wait 200
key b7 down
wait 500
spin K2 -2
wait 300
key b7 up
wait 300
expect sirk1 9
store31
reboot
wait 1000
expect format 36
expect sirk1 11
expect helpfit 0
